OL,3,GNEWSAThree convicted after fatal street
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurder after a man died from multiple
OL,8,Fstab wounds following a violent attack
OL,9,Fin Market Rasen, which police say
OL,10,Funfolded in full view of the public.
OL,12,FRyan Townhill, 30, of no fixed address,
OL,13,Fand Shannon Doocey, 32, of Mill Street,
OL,14,Fin the town, were convicted of the
OL,15,Fmurder of Danny Fowler following the
OL,16,Faltercation in Union Street on 12
OL,17,FMarch.
OL,19,FA third defendant, Martin Doocey, 55,
OL,20,Fof Waverley Court in the town, was
OL,21,Fconvicted of manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
